vs Exp-CPX-1 Δ -0.0047 (emission lost to spacing CELF) ·
vs Exp-CPX-3 Δ -0.0331 (physics fusion hurt catalogue recovery).
Recorded repo best: ATSC 0.1637. Static historical dots on the same folds (leaky benchmarks, not lanes):
GEMSDOE30 0.1616 · GEMSDOE32 0.0067.
Leakage canary: 94 features, max AUC 0.5887 ≤ 0.90 — PASS.</small></p></section>

